---
---
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="utf-8" />
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1" />
<title>Contact — Panamera Media Co</title>
<style>
*{margin:0;padding:0;box-sizing:border-box}
body{font-family:-apple-system,Inter,Helvetica,Arial;background:#fff;color:#0a0a0a}
.breaking{background:#0a0a0a;color:#fff;text-align:center;padding:8px 16px;font-size:10px;font-weight:800;letter-spacing:2px}
header{border-bottom:1.5px solid #0a0a0a;position:sticky;top:0;background:#fff;z-index:10}
.topbar{max-width:1100px;margin:0 auto;padding:16px 24px;display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center}
.logo{font-weight:900;letter-spacing:-1.5px;font-size:20px;text-decoration:none;color:#0a0a0a}
.container{max-width:1100px;margin:0 auto;padding:24px 24px 48px}
.section-label{margin:48px 0 8px;font-size:10px;font-weight:800;letter-spacing:2px;text-transform:uppercase;opacity:0.5}
.section-title{font-size:42px;font-weight:900;letter-spacing:-2px;line-height:0.9;margin-bottom:16px}
.pink{color:#FF2E93}.blue{color:#38B6FF}.yellow{color:#FFD60A}
.subtitle{font-size:16px;line-height:1.5;opacity:0.7;max-width:700px;margin-bottom:28px}
.grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fill,minmax(300px,1fr));gap:16px;margin-bottom:32px}
.card{border:1.5px solid #0a0a0a;border-radius:16px;background:#fff;padding:20px}
.card h4{font-size:14px;font-weight:900;margin-bottom:8px}
.card p{font-size:13px;line-height:1.5;opacity:0.7}
.badge{display:inline-block;background:#0a0a0a;color:#fff;font-size:9px;font-weight:900;letter-spacing:1.5px;padding:5px 10px;border-radius:999px;margin-bottom:12px}
.contact-box{border:2px solid #0a0a0a;border-radius:16px;padding:24px;background:#fff;margin:24px 0}
.contact-row{display:flex;gap:12px;flex-wrap:wrap;margin:16px 0}
.btn{display:inline-flex;border:1.5px solid #0a0a0a;border-radius:999px;padding:12px 20px;text-decoration:none;color:#0a0a0a;font-weight:800;font-size:12px;letter-spacing:1px}
.btn:hover{background:#0a0a0a;color:#fff}
.btn-pink{background:#FF2E93;color:#fff;border-color:#FF2E93}
.btn-blue{background:#38B6FF;color:#fff;border-color:#38B6FF}
input,textarea{width:100%;border:1.5px solid #0a0a0a;border-radius:12px;padding:12px 14px;font-family:inherit;font-size:14px;margin-bottom:12px;outline:none}
footer{border-top:1.5px solid #0a0a0a;padding:24px;text-align:center;font-size:10px;letter-spacing:2px;opacity:0.5;margin-top:48px}
.back{display:inline-flex;border:1.5px solid #0a0a0a;border-radius:999px;padding:8px 14px;text-decoration:none;color:#0a0a0a;font-weight:800;font-size:11px;letter-spacing:1px;margin-bottom:24px}
</style>
</head>
<body>
<div class="breaking">PANAMERA MEDIA CO • BOOKING & SERVICES</div>
<header><div class="topbar"><a class="logo" href="/">PANAMERA MEDIA CO</a><a href="/contact" style="font-size:10px;letter-spacing:2px;font-weight:800;text-decoration:none;color:#fff;background:#0a0a0a;border-radius:999px;padding:6px 12px">CONTACT</a></div></header>
<div class="container">
<a class="back" href="/">← BACK TO HOME</a>
<div class="section-label">SERVICES</div>
<div class="section-title"><span class="pink">LET'S</span> <span class="blue">WORK</span> <span class="yellow">TOGETHER</span></div>
<div class="subtitle">Festival coverage, film interviews, Sesiones En Vivo and new music. On the ground at Venice & Hamptons 2026. For screeners, bookings and collabs — chat with me.</div>

<div class="contact-box">
<h3>Contact / Chat</h3>
<div class="contact-row">
<a class="btn btn-pink" href="mailto:Javier@panameramedia.com">EMAIL: Javier@panameramedia.com →</a>
<a class="btn btn-blue" href="https://www.instagram.com/panameramediaco" target="_blank">DM @PANAMERAMEDIACO →</a>
</div>
</div>

<div class="grid">
  <div class="card"><div><span class="badge">FESTIVAL</span></div><h4>Festival Press Coverage</h4><p>World Premiere dispatches, red carpet, field notes. Venice, Hamptons.</p></div>
  <div class="card"><div><span class="badge" style="background:#38B6FF">FILM</span></div><h4>Film Interviews & Coverage</h4><p>Director / talent interviews, junkets, Q&As. English + Spanish.</p></div>
  <div class="card"><div><span class="badge" style="background:#FF2E93">SESIONES</span></div><h4>Sesiones En Vivo</h4><p>Live sessions production for emerging artists — video + podcast.</p></div>
  <div class="card"><div><span class="badge" style="background:#FFD60A;color:#0a0a0a">NEW MUSIC</span></div><h4>New Music / Nueva Música</h4><p>Premieres, Bolero Punk, indie discovery. Editorial + social push.</p></div>
</div>

<div class="contact-box" style="background:#0a0a0a;color:#fff">
<h3 style="color:#fff">Quick Message</h3>
<form action="mailto:Javier@panameramedia.com" method="post" enctype="text/plain">
<input type="text" name="Name" placeholder="Your name / Company" required />
<input type="email" name="Email" placeholder="Your email" required />
<textarea name="Message" rows="4" placeholder="Tell me what you need..." required></textarea>
<button type="submit" class="btn" style="background:#FF2E93;border-color:#FF2E93;color:#fff;width:100%;justify-content:center">SEND TO Javier@panameramedia.com →</button>
</form>
</div>

<footer>PANAMERA MEDIA CO © 2026 — Javier@panameramedia.com — @PANAMERAMEDIACO</footer>
</div>
</body>
</html>
